(Check Card Service Hours (Korean Standard Time, KST)/ and Remarks)
은행 전산시스템 점검시간을 제외한 24시간 이용 가능.
(· Available 24 hours a day, except during bank system maintenance hours.)
은행 전산시스템 점검시간 (· Bank system maintenance hours:)
일일 점검 시간 : 매일 23:59 ~ 00:05 (약 6분 내외)
(- Daily maintenance hours: Every day 23:59-00:05 (approximately six minutes)).
매월 3주차 첫 영업일 : 00:00 ~ 04:00 (약 4시간 내외)
(- The first business day of the third week of every month: 00:00-04:00 (approximately four hours).)
